{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rise. Rebel. Ruin.</strong></h2><br>Reignbreaker is a high-octane action rogue-like set in a dystopian medievalpunk world. Step into the boots of Clef, a fearless rebel determined to rid the world of the Kingdom\u2019s oppression as she lays siege to the Queen\u2019s grand Bastion.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129810/extras/RB_GIF_01_Advanced_Combat.gif?t=1746037436\" /><br><br>Smash, dash, and battle through hordes of hostile high-tech medieval machines to breach the heart of the fortress. Explore hand-crafted levels brimming with traps, secrets, and an embarrassment of hoarded wealth. Even parley with feisty loyalists, jaded soldiers, self-serving mercenaries, and haughty aristocrats as you penetrate the Bastion\u2019s depths and lay bare the arcane truths hidden within.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129810/extras/RB_GIF_03_Enemy_Spin.gif?t=1746037436\" /><br><br>Rise \u2013 stronger and more unrelenting \u2013 from every defeat and feel the punk spirit roar within your veins as you gain access to a growing arsenal of motorized javelins to experiment with. Smash the Kingdom, paint its walls with rebellion, and turn the Queen\u2019s lands into a battlefield as you become The Reignbreaker.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129810/extras/RB_GIF_05_Explore.gif?t=1746037436\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explosive, customizable combat with a growing arsenal of motorized javelins and power-ups.<br></li><li>Fast-paced and thrilling gameplay that rewards flashy combos, counters, and heavy hits.<br></li><li>A gripping story of rebellion and resilience set in a high-tech medieval dystopia.<br></li><li>Beautifully hand-crafted levels filled with enemies, traps, and hidden treasures.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rebel Girl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/3cea134c4a6a3fab7a60b69a6e642089fd78cb79.jpg"},{"name":"A New Morning, Changing Weather","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/030825e5fab712d6b2c43e41bd8fb33cd76f4c71.jpg"},{"name":"Guerilla Radio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/6e9d61ab6063751fadaca2bd8103ca9614149c6f.jpg"},{"name":"U Should Not Be Doing That","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/25a9d4c16a387d5c6532ca138ecdd2ed26f5c9e7.jpg"},{"name":"You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/9c38cf3ee18b5c3e5b81f512f3f39ce0cfcc81aa.jpg"},{"name":"I Am A Reignbreaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/a9fb1cead75e8f7b36b873e9ed8031b718db2a75.jpg"},{"name":"Night Nurse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/b16856fd73b3fbf515179e6b36c29abbf5256ee1.jpg"},{"name":"Good Rats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/5cde63dcdd8d5440b4ff6778175a6ad6fa525791.jpg"},{"name":"Broken Bones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/2eee63d288296e16ed8c4053eadeb6dc35728723.jpg"},{"name":"The Huntmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2129810/7073afcefd2a9daf48eb80e9abe6af754f6317e5.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2129810?t=1746037436","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746037436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2129810/34cf12d972cc25ee79e099fea1020866